sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Op as Operator or agent
  participant J as opentax-worker
  participant PG as opentax-pg
  participant M as Model provider
  participant UI as /agents and /review
  Op->>J: az containerapp job start --args "work run --loop ..."
  J->>PG: claim next assignment (fetch, decision, reviewer)
  J->>M: role call (meta, anthropic, openrouter, foundry)
  J->>PG: agent_runs row (cost, tokens, host, execution)
  UI->>PG: poll runs and scope status
  J->>PG: orchestrator run, loop ends on cap or empty queue
  UI-->>Op: verified proposals await signed-in approval
